  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project comprises capacity building of the Georgian Public Defender&apos;s Office and HR training. Furtehmore the project will strengthen the regional cooperation between the PDO&apos;s in the Southern Caucasus. Development objective is to contribute to improve the respect for HR in Georgia through the strengthening of the PDO and other key actors in the field of HR protection and promotion.</narrative>
